<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bloch says in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Bloch says in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bloch Ltd said on Tuesday it is talks which if successfully concluded may impact on the price of its shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange. Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
